        "id": "c1",
        "number": 1,
        "label": "The problem",
        "heading": "Why a refund needs a person",
        "components": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "id": "g1",
            "data": {
              "markdown": "Refunds are hard to undo. Once the money leaves, getting it back takes time and trust.\n\nA chat message can sit unread for hours. A ringing phone gets attention in seconds."
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "journey_steps",
            "id": "g2",
            "data": {
              "current": 2,
              "steps": [
                {
                  "title": "Agent decides",
                  "text_markdown": "The agent wants to refund an order."
                },
                {
                  "title": "Agent pauses",
                  "text_markdown": "It stops before the money moves."
                },
                {
                  "title": "A person decides",
                  "text_markdown": "One person approves or rejects."
                },
                {
                  "title": "Agent continues",
                  "text_markdown": "It refunds, or it stops."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "comparison_table",
            "id": "g3",
            "data": {
              "caption": "Three ways to reach the person who decides",
              "markdown": "| Route | Who sees it | How fast |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Slack group | Anyone who looks | When someone looks |\n| Pager | The person on call | Minutes |\n| Phone call | One named person | Seconds |"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "c2",
        "number": 2,
        "label": "How it works",
        "heading": "What happens when the agent asks",
        "components": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "id": "g4",
            "data": {
              "markdown": "The agent pauses before the refund and asks one person. The person approves or rejects. The agent reads the answer and carries on."
            }
          },
          {
